132
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:44,600
The key to trend trading is to get in close to the base, right?

133
00:07:44,600 --> 00:07:50,000
Because that's where you're going to have your risk management come in, right?

134
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:54,200
As price moves up and down, they'll often retrace back to the base.

135
00:07:54,200 --> 00:07:57,200
