140
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:06,321
So your stop is going to be placed

141
00:08:06,321 --> 00:08:07,912
just below the base in an

142
00:08:07,912 --> 00:08:10,298
uptrend or just above the highs in a downtrend.

143
00:08:10,500 --> 00:08:14,300
You're going to be placing it just on the other side of the base.

144
00:08:14,500 --> 00:08:15,833
That's why trading around

